	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Hodie ex <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> habuimus literas, inter quas quidam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p18113">Mecardus</persName> nomine, qui illic adhuc strenue praedicat de concilio, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>talia scribit, quae quoniam forte tibi non erunt ingrata cognitu, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>transscribam huc: "De concilio nihil, quod scribam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Doctor <persName ref="p18137">Marpachius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>(est is <placeName ref="l491">Argentinensis</placeName> ecclesiae minister) fuit <placeName ref="l1678">Niddae</placeName> apud <persName ref="p9046">Pistorium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in <placeName ref="l213">Hassia</placeName>, fuit <placeName ref="l157">Franckfordię</placeName>, <placeName ref="l284">Lipsiae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName>, apud Io<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>annem marchionem et <placeName ref="l361">Norinbergę</placeName>; sic scribit ad <persName ref="p20811">Ascanium</persName>, <persName ref="p3207">regis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Angliae</persName> legatum, d. <persName ref="p8121">Montius</persName> atque inter alia: Nova hic nulla <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>habemus praeterquam <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthonem</persName> modo conscribere confessionem <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fidei earum ecclesiarum, quae evangelium per <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>profitentur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Similiter <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> et <persName ref="p1055">Frechtus</persName> nostrorum theo<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>logorum opera in eodem argumento laborant, ut ex his conscripti<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>onibus collatis et recognitis una tandem absoluta <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>confessio, quae omnium nostrorum theologorum assensu et iudici<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>o exhibeatur in concilio (si quod fuerit) et fidei <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nostrae ratio coram universo mundo reddatur.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Et si praeterea <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>papa nostros volet iniquis abusibus, temerariis praeiudiciis et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>usurpatis superstitionibus tyrannice premere, ut tum declinationes<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>, accusationes, exceptiones et omnis generis defensiones <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>opponant et protestentur tam contra suspectum, imo inimicum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et hostilem iudicem quam contra universum iudicium, quod in <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>propria causa cognitionem, accusationem et condemnationem sibi contra <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>fas et leges arrogantissime vendicet.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Haec ille."</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Scripsit et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>alias post illas priores <persName ref="p18113">Mecardus</persName> ad <persName ref="p8417">Musculum</persName> literas, in <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quibus haec habet: <foreign xml:lang="de">"Mir ist den 1. tag augsten überschickt <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>worden ein copy deß convents zuͦ <placeName ref="l558">Wittemberg</placeName>, den 5. iulii <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>gehalten, da alle gelerten beider universiteten, <placeName ref="l284">Leiptzig</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>und <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName>, sampt allen superintendenten beider <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>fürsten, <persName ref="p18250">Moritzen</persName> und <persName>Augusti</persName>, und ist ein confession <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>von <persName>Philippo</persName> gstellt, examiniert, approbiert und von <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>allen subscribiert worden,</foreign> quae offeretur in concilio futuro, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>cui <persName>Iohannis, marchionis Brandenburgensis</persName>, ministri subscripsere, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>item <persName>ducis Pomeranię</persName> et <persName>ducis Meckelburgensis</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Faciunt <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quoque in fine mentionem civitatis <placeName>Nerobergensis</placeName> et <placeName ref="l491">Argen<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>toratensis</placeName>, quod et ipsae huic sint subscripturae.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Haec habui <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ad concilium pertinentia.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quid <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> geratur, te non puto <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ignorare; scripsit <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName> quaedam ad <persName ref="p1754">Iungium</persName> quae <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>sine dubio tibi quoque prius communicavit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Der renntmeister <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ist wider verhanden,</foreign> forte iam est vobiscum; a quo cognosces <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>mira.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><persName ref="p2916">Schertli</persName> ist in anstößen <placeName ref="l631">Burgund</placeName> und <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName>; <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>weiß nitt, was vorhanden ist.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Haec satis importuno tempore <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>scripsi, ne omnino nihil scriberem per hunc doctissimum et optimum <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>virum, fratrem nostrum d. <persName ref="p8033">Theodorum Bezam</persName>, qui valde <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>vestras desiderat videre facies; eum tibi et reliquis <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>fratribus omnibus commendo, quos ex me salutabis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>vos quoque nostri, praesertim <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>, cuius venter fluere <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>nondum desiit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> 15. augusti sub cre<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>pusculum vespertinum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z49"/>Tuus, quem nosti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti fidelissimo, domino et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>compatri charissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
